  (a) both "unit4" is dried and "unit4" is scanned;
  (b) "unit4" is audited, then "unit0" is classified as "sound_signal_audible".

[N8] If all of the following hold:
  (a) both "unit4" is clipped and "unit4" is logged;
  (b) "unit4" is shipped, then "unit0" is classified as "sound_casing_intact".

[N40] All of the following hold:
  (a) all of the following hold:
    (i) if "unit4" is numbered, then "unit4" is classified as "clear_optically_transparent";
    (ii) if "unit4" is bagged, then "unit5" is classified as "clear_contamination_absent";
  (b) if "unit4" is wrapped, then "unit5" is classified as "clear_optically_transparent".
